{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shadows of the Deepforge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the pride of dwarven craftsmanship, the Deepforge now lies in ruins, its halls crawling with goblins who plunder what remains.<br>You are the blade in the darkness \u2014 an assassin who dares to slip into the broken city\u2019s depths in search of relics that carry the legacy of your fallen kin.<br>Every strike must be precise. Every step must be unseen. For the shadows are not your enemy\u2026 they are your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reclaim the treasures of the Deepforge, or vanish forever in its endless dark?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961860/extras/a6709691730807bcddffaa8bc29ced0e.avif?t=1755904698\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br><br>Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Blade with a Voice</strong> \u2013 Your dagger whispers guidance, secrets, and warnings as you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Dungeon Delving</strong> \u2013 Navigate winding tunnels, forgotten camps, cities, and crumbling ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Dialogue unfolds between you and your weapon, shaping your journey in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Encounters</strong> \u2013 Face goblins, cultists, and lurking horrors with careful combat and environmental awareness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Every cavern, chamber, and ruin hints at a deeper history waiting to be uncovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Ambience</strong> \u2013 Dynamic lighting, haunting soundscapes, and hidden details create a rich, eerie world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Through 